sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Mobile as Codex Mobile
  participant Factory as Project Factory API
  participant Runner as Scaffold Runner
  participant Providers as Target Providers
  participant GitHub
  participant Cloudflare
  participant Workbench
  participant Domain as Domain Factory

  User->>Mobile: New Project / Scaffold
  Mobile->>Factory: Load modes, presets, providers
  Factory-->>Mobile: Recommended stack and infrastructure choices
  User->>Mobile: Name, stack, Cloudflare, AWS readiness
  Mobile->>Factory: Create scaffold draft
  Factory-->>Mobile: Contract preview and remote effects
  User->>Mobile: Confirm scaffold
  Mobile->>Factory: Start or resume scaffold job
  Factory->>Runner: Execute approved contract
  Runner->>Providers: Plan, scaffold, validate targets
  Providers-->>Runner: Evidence, artifacts, blockers
  Runner->>GitHub: Create/verify and push when configured
  Runner->>Cloudflare: Generate/provision neutral preview when selected
  Runner->>Workbench: Verify workspace and SDD discovery
  Runner-->>Factory: scaffold_ready or blocked_with_context
  Factory-->>Mobile: Result, links, pending product work
  Mobile-->>User: Open workspace or Start Product
  User->>Mobile: Start Product
  Mobile->>Factory: Explicit start-product action
  Factory->>Domain: Reuse scaffold context and workspace
